add('29371242','campus_f9','Varje måndag morgon samlas förskoleklass till årskurs fyra i Aulan för en gemensam morgonsamling. Här blandas elevuppträdanden och utmärkelser med klassisk musik och körsång.','Sustained weekly assembly with performance, classical music and choir; F–4 only. Supported creative/arts learning routine, not an arts-specialist school or evidence about years 5–9.',ART,'Weekly music/performing assembly (F–4)','Supported')
add('29410344','kungsholm_listing','Närheten till Mälaren med omgivningar och stadens kulturutbud används som lärmiljöer i undervisningen.','Uncertain: local settings used for teaching, but frequency, structure and approach not specified. Reviewed page F–6, official unit spans 1–9. No firm outdoor/arts code; 7–9 follow-up remains.')
add('29497099','ies_teaching','Up to half of the education is conducted in English, and teachers have a great deal of experience in helping students learn to command the English language, using language immersion.','Södertälje-specific FAQ hosting provider-wide wording; local about page explicitly identifies this school as bilingual. Up to half, not exactly half, and F–3 introduction gradual. No inference from outcomes.',LANG,'Swedish–English bilingual education; language immersion')
